    "title": "开启进货单单行折扣教程",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/8458d52a880268cd906c0b2d07e54dc5.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video>\n<strong>操作路径：</strong></p>\n<p>（1）设置-系统设置-勾选启用单行折扣。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202311/0866f213d69ca718e78fdb8c27a237ed.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>（2）进货-新增进货单-点击左侧设置按钮，把折扣，折后价添加到已显示字段里，然后点击确认。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202311/4dfebb2812e0e2883b5c24043f3b4507.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>（3）开进货单即可输入单个商品的折扣率。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202311/533829751e744d29d2274363674f679e.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
